    "body": "## Purpose\nFixes the missing logprobs on the streaming parser derender path noted in RFC #47161 and PR #55029 (\"That parsed path does not resolve logprobs yet; when it does, mirror the generate chat streaming path...\").\n\nPreviously, `_derender_chat_stream_parsed()` in `OnlineDerenderer` dropped incoming logprobs from `GenerateTokensStreamChoice` and constructed `ChatCompletionResponseStreamChoice` without resolving or attaching them. \n\nThis PR:\n1. **Resolves logprobs on the parsed path**: When `choice.logprobs` is present, resolves them via `_resolve_logprobs` with the carried context and attaches them to `ChatCompletionResponseStreamChoice`.\n2. **Honors reasoning privacy**: Aligns with `OpenAIServingChat.chat_completion_stream_generator` by suppressing logprobs (`resolved_logprobs = None`) when `include_reasoning=False`, preventing leakage of hidden reasoning tokens through logprob entries.\n3. **Preserves cross-chunk context**: Updates `stream_state.logprob_context_token_ids` in `_derender_chat_stream_parsed` so byte-fallback (U+FFFD) decoding remains consistent across chunk boundaries.\n4. **Updates documentation**: Updates `derenderer.md` to document that both plain and parser-configured streaming derender paths resolve logprobs, and notes the reasoning-suppression behavior.\n\nCC @hickeyma @DarkLight1337 @shimib\n\n## Test Plan\n- Unit test coverage:\n  ```bash\n  pytest tests/entrypoints/scale_out/derender/test_derender_stream.py -k \"test_parsed_stream\"\n  ```\n  Adds `test_parsed_stream_resolves_logprobs` and `test_parsed_stream_suppresses_logprobs_when_reasoning_hidden` verifying both resolution and reasoning-suppression behavior.\n- Linter and style checks:\n  ```bash\n  ruff check vllm/renderers/online_derenderer.py tests/entrypoints/scale_out/derender/test_derender_stream.py\n  ruff format --check vllm/renderers/online_derenderer.py tests/entrypoints/scale_out/derender/test_derender_stream.py\n  ```\n\n## Test Result\n- New unit tests:\n  - `test_parsed_stream_resolves_logprobs`: **PASSED**\n  - `test_parsed_stream_suppresses_logprobs_when_reasoning_hidden`: **PASSED**\n- All 8 unit tests in `TestDerenderChatStreamParsed` pass cleanly.\n- End-to-end HTTP integration test via FastAPI `TestClient` over `/v1/chat/completions/derender`:\n  - Verified chunk contains resolved `logprobs` with `include_reasoning=True`.\n  - Verified chunk suppresses `logprobs` to `None` with `include_reasoning=False`.\n- All `ruff` lint and formatting checks passed.\n\n## AI Assistance\nAI assistance (Devin) was used to develop, test, and prepare this pull request. All changes were inspected, verified, and run locally.\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)",
